Q: Pure CSS Continuous Horizontal Text Scroll Without Break A: <p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>/* Core functionality */
#animated-text-strip{
  display: flex;
  flex-flow: row nowrap;
  align-items: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}
#animated-text-strip .marquee {
  white-space: nowrap;
  animation: marquee 5s linear infinite;
  max-width: none;
}

@keyframes marquee {
  0% {
    transform: translate(0, 0);
  }
  100% {
    transform: translate(-100%, 0);
  }
}

